TEXT -1144 1032 Left 2 !* 1. Average Voltage & Current (Steady-State: 20ms - 25ms)\n.meas tran Vout1_avg AVG V(Vout1) TRIG time=20m TARG time=25m\n.meas tran Vout2_avg AVG V(Vout2) TRIG time=20m TARG time=25m\n.meas tran I_in_avg AVG -I(Vin) TRIG time=20m TARG time=25m\n \n* 2. Input & Output Power (P = V^2 / R ve P = V * I)\n.meas tran P_out1 PARAM (Vout1_avg * Vout1_avg) / 10\n.meas tran P_out2 PARAM (Vout2_avg * Vout2_avg) / 10\n.meas tran P_out_total PARAM P_out1 + P_out2\n.meas tran P_in PARAM V(N002) * I_in_avg\n \n* 3. Efficiency\n.meas tran Efficiency_Percent PARAM (P_out_total / P_in) * 100
